[38;5;173m⏺[0m Five of six shoppers abandoned a checkout last month because it asked for an account.
  Three themes come up again and again:
  
    1. Account creation feels like a trap (P2, P3, P5)
    2. Card entry on mobile is the slowest step (P1, P2, P4)
    3. Express pay builds trust when it is offered first (P4, P6)

